  <div class="insight-box">
    <h4>Bringing in expert authority</h4>
    <p>Beyond interviewing opticians and optometrists for background knowledge, I translated their clinical insights into accessible content for a general audience. Noticing an opportunity to strengthen credibility, I suggested including direct quotes from these experts within the blogs themselves, adding a visible layer of trust and authority beyond the writing alone. My manager liked the approach, and it became a practice the team continued using more consistently going forward.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section-container fadeIn delay-800">
