      <h2>Multi-Channel Promotion</h2>
      <br>
      <br>
      <p>Publishing strong content wasn&#39;t the end of the process, getting it in front of the right audience was just as important. Each blog was promoted through a coordinated mix of channels: shared via social media, featured in email newsletters with a teaser designed to drive click-through, and reinforced with internal linking across the site to keep readers engaged and improve overall SEO structure.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

